  "description": "Forget noisy training wheels! There is no better way to teach your kids to ride than putting them on a balance bike. Most children can start scooting around within a few hours, and the sense of balance they acquire will make it easy for them to step up to pedal bikes later. The Mia is uber cute and even comes with a miniature wicker basket. It has an adjustable seat and handlebar height that will let the bike grow with your child. The Mia has unique styling making it different from most ‘plastic-fantastic’ bikes on the market. It has an adjustable seat and handlebar height that will let the bike grow with your child. Steel frame and fork,12” wheels, aluminum rims, comfortable children’s saddle, super soft grips with safe gummy barends, aluminum handlebar, and wicker basket. The top of the saddle in the lowest position is 37 cm above the ground. The highest position of the saddle is 48cm above the ground. Available in five superb colours – Donuts, Gold Chic, Pale Peach, Tiffany Blue, and Red Polka. Suitable for girls approximately 88 - 104 cm high (2-4 years old).",
